# BRE_B Mock Simulator

## Variables de Entorno

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/mipit-adapter-breb
NEXT_PUBLIC_RAIL_NAME=BRE_B
PORT=3003
```

## Desarrollo

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Puerto: **http://localhost:3003**

## Production

```bash
npm run build
npm start
```

## Docker

```bash
docker build -t mock-breb .
docker run -p 3003:3003 -e NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://mipit-adapter-breb:5003 mock-breb
```
